    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you defeat enemies, you can upgrade your existing abilities and unlock new ones. As you progress, let the game play for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463250/extras/2f3e33f2e602298a2694f7f72d462a3e.poster.avif?t=1742044880\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463250/extras/2f3e33f2e602298a2694f7f72d462a3e.webm?t=1742044880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463250/extras/2f3e33f2e602298a2694f7f72d462a3e.mp4?t=1742044880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463250/extras/a80dc7c6dab91b60eb949b8604edcd98.webp?t=1742044880\" width=19 height=19 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 Core Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are abilities that empower you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463250/extras/ba71a8b055119122d1732104bd952e37.poster.avif?t=1742044880\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463250/extras/ba71a8b055119122d1732104bd952e37.webm?t=1742044880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463250/extras/ba71a8b055119122d1732104bd952e37.mp4?t=1742044880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=